# Data and curriculum

Course content lives under `src/lib/data/`. Assembly hub: `courseData.js`.

## Assembly (`courseData.js`)

- `siteOverview` — marketing copy, `learningPaths`, study tracks, study loop, reading list
- `rawModules` / `rawLowLevelModules` — core HLD + LLD lessons
- Expansion modules concatenated: `hldModules`, `lldModules`, `dsaModules`, `aiModules`
- DSA concept labs without highlights inherit runnable `questionHighlights` via `dsaExpansionPracticeSourceBySlug`
- `flowDefinitions` → `courseFlows`, `modules`, `allLessons`, indexes
- Helpers: `getFlowBySlug`, `getModuleBySlug`, `getLessonBySlug`, `getModuleProgress`, `getLessonPracticeSteps`, `getResumeLesson`

## Flow-specific sources

| File | Flow |
|------|------|
| `courseData.js` | Core HLD + LLD lessons |
| `hldLearningExpansion.js` | HLD labs: systems fundamentals, reliability/observability with full on-page sections, code examples, and exercises |
| `lldLearningExpansion.js` | LLD labs: design patterns, project labs |
| `dsaCourseData.js` | DSA interview practice modules |
| `dsaLearningExpansion.js` | DSA concept + algorithm labs with on-page stdlib Python examples and coding exercises |
| `aiEngineerCourseData.js` | AI modules; many lessons include runnable `exercises[]` |
| `aiLearningExpansion.js` | Interactive ML + deep learning from-scratch labs with full on-page teaching sections, code examples, and exercises |
| `questionBankCourseData.js` | Bank lessons with `questionBank: { key, label, kind }` |

## Modules by flow

- **HLD (11):** foundations … case-studies + `systems-fundamentals-lab`, `reliability-observability-lab`
- **LLD (6):** lld-foundations … lld-machine-coding + `lld-design-patterns-lab`, `lld-project-labs`
- **DSA (6):** dsa-foundations … dsa-mock-loops + `dsa-concepts-lab`, `dsa-algorithms-lab`
- **AI (10):** ml-foundations … data-engineering-for-ml + `ml-interactive-lab`, `deep-learning-from-scratch`
- **Question bank (4):** question-bank-top-sets, question-bank-faang, question-bank-more-companies, question-bank-strategy

## Lesson shape (typical)

`slug`, `title`, `summary`, `duration`, `whyItMatters`, `sections[]` (`heading`, `body`, `bullets?`, `codeExample?`), `checklist[]`, `pitfalls[]`, `interviewPrompts[]`, `diagram|null`, `related[]`. Optional: `likelyAnswerPoints`, `practiceMode`, `runtimeTarget`, `questionHighlights`, `questionBank`, `exercises`, `interactive`. DSA/AI learning labs may use `exercises[]` with `starterCode`, `solution`, `hints`, and `expectedOutput` for in-page coding practice.

AI learning expansion lessons under `ml-interactive-lab` and `deep-learning-from-scratch` are self-contained concept lessons: 5-7 long sections per lesson, multiple `codeExample` snippets, and at least two runnable coding exercises.

Ids: `{moduleSlug}/{lessonSlug}` via `normalizeModule()`.

## Deep knowledge (`lessonDeepKnowledge.js`)

- `getLessonDeepKnowledge(lessonId)` — curated deeper insights + external references per lesson
- Sources under `deepKnowledge/` including `learningExpansionDeepKnowledge.js` for the 24 expansion lessons
- Each entry: `insights[]` (`heading`, `body`) and `references[]` (`title`, `url`, `source`, `note`)
- Loaded in lesson route (`+page.js`) and rendered in the lesson page **Deep dive** section

## Banks and extras

- Question JSON (lazy in `QuestionBankIDE`): `top-interview-questions-*.json`, company files, strategy files — normalized by `src/lib/dsa/questionBank.js`
- DSA also pulls `all-companies-questions.json`, `leetcode-companies.json`
- `interactiveLessons.js` — authored topic labs (`getInteractiveLesson`)
- `simulationLessons.js` — authored + generated HLD sims (`getSimulationLesson`)
- `lessonEnhancements.js` + `solutionLoader.js` — rich solutions for case studies
- Diagrams: `/primer-images/*` under `static/` (asserted in `tests/courseData.test.js`)
